# Security

Prototype only. Not UNECE R155 / WP.29 certified.

- Cloud credentials and TLS keys never go in git. Use environment or gitignored files.
- CAN anomaly detection is a monitor (unknown ID, flood, bad DLC/counter), not a type approval.
- Rate-limit diagnostic and BLE writes. Log security event IDs.
- Do not treat MQTT or BLE as a safety channel.

Document limitations next to any auth, pairing, or encryption code.
